WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

NOTE
Starter captions for the U9itus welcome tour narration.
Timings are estimates (~150 wpm); adjust to match your final recording.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The U9itus U.S. map is totally interactive.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.500
It allows you immediate access to political representatives in all states

3
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:18.500
by simply pointing your mouse on the desired state to review,

4
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.500
by clicking on this state.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:28.000
The state will separate away from all other states

6
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.500
and will show area divisions populating into districts,

7
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:40.500
and names of political representatives serving in these districts.

8
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:46.000
Find the representatives serving any area in the United States.

9
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Click on their names and find out all about them.

10
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:57.500
You can check what they stand for from various reliable resources.

11
00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:04.000
You can also find out who is bankrolling their campaigns

12
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.000
— right here at U9itus.

13
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:13.500
In upcoming seasons, this information will be vital

14
00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:19.000
in your making an intelligent choice when you go to the polls.
